∧\n      (∫ ω, ((baseRun ω).2 : ℝ) ∂μ) = (∫ ω, ((targetRun ω).2 : ℝ) ∂μ) ∧\n      (∫ ω, ((baseRun ω).2 : ℝ) ∂μ) ≤ (fuel : ℝ)\n","truth_boundary":"Exact author-derived measurable seeded finite-fuel reply simulation and both concrete fixed-spectrum FO/MV program-specific joint laws and actual costs only. Keeps full final state, tagged some/none, every-seed deterministic cap and ordinary expected count equality<=fuel. No universal source representation, successful Gaussian sampling/TV/Q_G equivalence, joint random-O/Haar law, 2T hidden-block reduction, adaptive indistinguishability, C6/L44 or either main lower bound. Reader runtime/independent visual, normal V, safe public export, main/global production integration and purification are separate.","verified_carrier_vs_actual_build":{"actual_native_build_identity":"57016008083947405bc7d430838537014a40f987","bare_parent_or_future_carrier_not_retroactively_built":true,"checked_metadata_carrier":"45618f04aadca61dbf235becfc5583d1735c7ead"},"verified_commit":"45618f04aadca61dbf235becfc5583d1735c7ead","verifier_id":"adaptive_oracle_native_61e4_independent_verifier"},"from_state":"PROVED_LOCAL","modes":["proof-design","compiler-diagnosis","source-review"],"schema_version":4,"to_state":"VERIFIED","worker_id":"adaptive_oracle_native_61e4_independent_verifier"}
